    iommu: qcom_iommu: Add the MSM8226 GPU configuration
    
    Original integration rationale and historical observations follow. These
    observations do not qualify hardware on this refreshed base.
    
    The MSM8226 GPU SMMU is OS-managed like the MSM8974 one and uses the
    same GFX3D user and privileged stream IDs, but its vendor description
    sets different prefetch (BFB) values and enables halting while context
    banks are programmed. Add a configuration with those values.
    
    Original integration AI credit: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>.
    
    Refreshed from integration source
    60fa2a06552bb98e447d52d31aa8f36723bafe46. Current-base adaptation and
    host qualification used OpenAI Codex. Human review and new DCO
    certification remain pending.

